---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="IWAG 2027: Fantastic Arcana" description="Independent IWAG V2 information preview.">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">IWAG 2027 · FANTASTIC ARCANA</p>
      <h1 id="home-title">IWAG 2027: <em>Fantastic Arcana</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">A weekend beyond the ordinary, built around creativity, community, and anthropomorphic art.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="action-link" href="/en/about/">Discover the gathering</a>
        <a class="action-link secondary" href="/en/participate/">Explore participation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="arcana-art" role="img" aria-label="Abstract decorative illustration representing an illuminated arcane academy">
      <span class="arcana-orbit orbit-one"></span><span class="arcana-orbit orbit-two"></span>
      <span class="arcana-core" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><span class="arcana-caption" aria-hidden="true">AETHER · LEY LINES · DISCOVERY</span>
    </div>
    <div class="event-facts">
      <div><span>WHEN</span><strong>3–4 July 2027</strong></div>
      <div><span>WHERE</span><strong>Hotel Ciputra Jakarta</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-section">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2>A new home in West Jakarta</h2></div>
    <div class="venue-panel">
      <div class="venue-visual" aria-hidden="true"><span>JAKARTA</span><strong>06</strong><small>WEST · INDONESIA</small></div>
      <div class="venue-copy"><p>The published 2027 venue is Hotel Ciputra Jakarta. Event spaces are announced on the sixth floor, with a connection to Mal Ciputra Jakarta.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/location/">Explore the venue</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-section faq-section">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">QUICK GUIDE</p><h2>Good to know</h2><p>A few quick answers before planning your weekend.</p></div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>When is IWAG 2027?</summary><p>The published event dates are 3–4 July 2027.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Where will it take place?</summary><p>The published venue is Hotel Ciputra Jakarta, West Jakarta.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Are event passes available?</summary><p>The participation page currently marks pass options as coming soon. Check the official source for changes.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-section updates-section">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FROM THE COMMUNITY</p><h2>Latest updates</h2><p>Announcements and notes from the community.</p></div>
    <div class="update-grid">
      <article class="update-card"><span class="update-date">15 NOV 2026</span><h3>Welcome to West Jakarta</h3><p>The 2027 gathering has a new home at Hotel Ciputra Jakarta.</p><a href="/en/updates/2026-11-15-venue-reveal/">Read update</a></article>
      <article class="update-card"><span class="update-date">08 NOV 2026</span><h3>Join our Team</h3><p>A call for people interested in helping deliver the next gathering.</p><a href="/en/updates/2026-11-08-staff-applications/">Read update</a></article>
      <article class="update-card"><span class="update-date">14 JUL 2026</span><h3>IWAG 2026 — Memories</h3><p>A look back at the previous weekend.</p><a href="/en/updates/2026-07-14-conclusion/">Read update</a></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <p class="source-note">Reference details captured from public source pages on 23 November 2026. Recheck volatile event details before relying on them.</p>
  <aside class="project-notice"><strong>Independent V2 project</strong><p>This is an independent recreation, not an official IWAG website and not endorsed by the event organisers.</p></aside>
</BaseLayout>
